{
    "title": "Stitch Fix: Style made easy",
    "description": "Make style easy with Stitch Fix, the #1 online personal shopping service for women, men and kids. Take our simple style quiz to share your style, size and budget, then get matched with a (real, human!) Stylist who gets you. Choosing from 1,000s of brands and styles, they send personalized pieces that get your style and fit just right. Let your personal Stylist select 5 just-for-you items per box (it\u2019s called a \u201cFix\u201d), and get access to personalized style advice and recommendations in your unique \u201cFreestyle\u201d shop. Free shipping and returns, no subscription required.\r\n\r\nFREE SHIPPING + NO SUBSCRIPTION REQUIRED\r\nShipping, returns and exchanges are always free (label included). Order Fix boxes on demand, or opt for regular deliveries, it\u2019s up to you. When you keep all 5 items, get 25% off the entire order.\r\n\r\nONLINE PERSONAL STYLING FOR EVERYONE\r\nWomen\u2019s sizes 0-24W (XS-3X) including Plus, Petite and Maternity.\u2028Men\u2019s sizes XS-3XL, waists 28-48 and inseams 28-36, including Big + Tall\u2028Kids sizes 2T-18\r\n\r\nYOUR STYLE ON YOUR BUDGET\r\nFrom statement pieces to everyday items, your Stylist shops exclusively within your chosen price range. Set your budget by category: Blazers, shirts, pants, and more. Items start around $32 for women and men,  and at $12 for kids.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Make style easy with Stitch Fix, the #1 online personal shopping service for women, men and kids. Take our simple style quiz to share your style, size and budget, then get matched with a (real, human!) Stylist who gets you. Choosing from 1,000s of brands and styles, they send personalized pieces that get your style and fit just right. Let your personal Stylist select 5 just-for-you items per box (it\u2019s called a \u201cFix\u201d), and get access to personalized style advice and recommendations in your unique \u201cFreestyle\u201d shop. Free shipping and returns, no subscription required.<br><br>FREE SHIPPING + NO SUBSCRIPTION REQUIRED<br>Shipping, returns and exchanges are always free (label included). Order Fix boxes on demand, or opt for regular deliveries, it\u2019s up to you. When you keep all 5 items, get 25% off the entire order.<br><br>ONLINE PERSONAL STYLING FOR EVERYONE<br>Women\u2019s sizes 0-24W (XS-3X) including Plus, Petite and Maternity.\u2028Men\u2019s sizes XS-3XL, waists 28-48 and inseams 28-36, including Big + Tall\u2028Kids sizes 2T-18<br><br>YOUR STYLE ON YOUR BUDGET<br>From statement pieces to everyday items, your Stylist shops exclusively within your chosen price range. Set your budget by category: Blazers, shirts, pants, and more. Items start around $32 for women and men,  and at $12 for kids.",
